          <div class="li"><span>Sewa Bulanan (Th 2+)</span><span>~Rp 2,5 Jt</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="paket-card">
        <div class="paket-head"><div class="kicker">Mitra Punya Lokasi</div><h3>Paket Own Location</h3><div class="price">Rp 125 Jt</div></div>
        <div class="paket-body">
          <div class="li"><span>License Fee</span><span>Rp 25 Jt</span></div>
          <div class="li"><span>RSF — Stok Bahan Baku</span><span>Rp 50 Jt</span></div>
          <div class="li"><span>Equipment + POS</span><span>Rp 25 Jt</span></div>
          <div class="li"><span>Renovasi &amp; Dekorasi</span><span>Rp 25 Jt</span></div>
